Modern Terminal

A fork of the Eclipse Terminal (https://github.com/eclipse-platform/eclipse.platform, directory terminal/),
taken from commit ea81a95 (2026-10-19) together with the changes proposed upstream in
eclipse-platform/eclipse.platform pull requests 2894, 2899-2905, 2973 and 2979.

Packages and bundle IDs were renamed from org.eclipse.terminal to io.github.insjang.terminal
so that it installs beside the Eclipse Terminal.

The original copyright notices are kept in each file.
