Third-party content

The bundle io.github.insjang.terminal.connector.process contains os/win32/{x86_64,aarch64}/conpty.dll and
OpenConsole.exe from the NuGet package Microsoft.Windows.Console.ConPTY 1.25.260930003
(https://github.com/microsoft/terminal), unmodified, under the MIT License
